========== 4. JF-3 — the spec 7.6 issue-responsiveness figure, per crate member ==========
Rule: "10 most recently opened issues | median days to first maintainer
response; unanswered count". Pull requests are excluded (the /issues
endpoint mixes them in). "Maintainer" = a comment whose author_association
is OWNER, MEMBER or COLLABORATOR and who is not the issue author. The
median is taken over the ANSWERED subset; the unanswered count is reported
beside it, never folded into it. No account login or e-mail is printed.

